# Build context for this directory's Dockerfile is this directory. Only
# patches/ is ever COPYed from it; the rest is documentation, host-side
# tooling, and investigation output (the ORT backend-test logs are tens of
# megabytes), none of which belongs in a context transfer. Mirrors
# gfx803/.dockerignore and the repo-root one.
#
# This does not affect layer caching: BuildKit keys a COPY on the checksums of
# the files it actually copies, not on the whole context.
*.md
*.log
tools/
